{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>視后佘詩曼（阿佘）向來喜歡在社交平台分享生活點滴，今日（11月25日）她在IG上載一張身處機艙內的自拍照，卻被眼利網民發現她竟然Tag了韓國超人氣女團BLACKPINK的官方帳號。</p><figure><img alt=\"阿佘經常分享日常。（IG@charmaine_sheh）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202298748009451520609432.jpeg/cONlc40yZURKS6RuIkxznuKlQrui2AEIHmlBPR5pQT0\"/><figcaption>阿佘經常分享日常。（IG@charmaine_sheh）</figcaption></figure><p>機艙內戴黑超心情大靚</p><p>從佘詩曼上載的相片可見，當時她正坐在飛機內，身穿白色緊身上衣配搭羊羔毛牛仔外套，並戴上型格黑超，對著鏡頭甜笑揮手打招呼，心情大靚。她更留言表示雖然距離上次搭飛機只有一段短時間，但依然感到莫名興奮，並向粉絲預告很快見面。</p><figure><img alt=\"佘詩曼IG手誤Tag錯BLACKPINK帳號。（IG@charmaine_sheh）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202298279207899136960382.jpeg/BmJtUuxVphmTfW0E-ppq_wJAbRh5rz1KT7utOk-7rTo\"/><figcaption>佘詩曼IG手誤Tag錯BLACKPINK帳號。（IG@charmaine_sheh）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓國女團BLACKPINK。（IG@blackpinkofficial）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230730/762326581174603776205196.jpeg/gAe5DZAx0yvYEWXny5eCWEgcMN-8xrkE1GBU1dRgVNU\"/><figcaption>韓國女團BLACKPINK。（IG@blackpinkofficial）</figcaption></figure><p>眼利網民揭發手誤真相</p><p>不過，有網民驚見佘詩曼在圖片中標記了「blackpinkofficial」的帳號，驚呼「Charmaine同BLACKPINK？？？」、「阿佘點解tag BLACKPINK嘅？」，一度以為雙方有破天荒合作。但很快就有心水清的網民「破案」，指佘詩曼應該是想Tag她所佩戴的太陽眼鏡品牌「BLACKPALM」，卻因串法相似而一時手誤選錯帳號，烏龍舉動相當可愛。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:03:57.832083+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":510,"images":3,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T14:45:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T14:57:28.177265+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T14:57:28.177265+00:00","content_hash":"da60cae7db35ecfbdd3ce74e291b74f8ddad5c8eec23e626a241a44090c6810b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}